      "preconditions": "Level 2, communication session with RBC established, train running in a mode with valid MA (e.g., FS). The current MA has an EOA/LOA at a known distance ahead. The train front end position is estimated to be significantly in rear of the proposed shortened MA's Indication supervision limit.",
